<bug_description>Backport PR #9907 (CoCO confidential-container image-server support) to cri-o release-1.35. Introduces ImageServiceManager/RuntimeServiceManager in internal/storage, changes GetImageService/GetRuntimeService to return errors, passes the runtime handler to image/runtime services, and threads the ImageServer interface through pullArguments. The mainline code keys service caches per SandboxInfo, which does not exist on release-1.35 -- adapt the feature to the runtime-handler-keyed model consistent with the 1.35 codebase, and port the PR's unit tests so they compile against the adapted API.
</bug_description>
<issue_id>crio-coco-imageserver-9907</issue_id>
