commit 238e105273e402c61ee83b411119250958241b2b
Author: Julien Ropé <jrope@redhat.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 10 16:01:20 2026 +0200

    server: extract PodName helper and add debug log for image pull fallback
    
    The sandbox name format was duplicated between internal/lib/sandbox/builder.go
    and server/image_pull.go, risking silent divergence if either side changed.
    Extract a PodName(meta) helper in the sandbox package and use it in both
    places.
    
    Also add a Debugf log when PodIDForName fails during PullImage so operators
    can diagnose unexpected fallbacks to the host image store for CoCo runtimes.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Signed-off-by: Julien Ropé <jrope@redhat.com>

